      "Title": "Doji.AI.Segmentation.MobileSAM",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Doji.AI.Segmentation.MobileSAM.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Predictor using MobileSAM models.\nCall <xref href=\"Doji.AI.Segmentation.MobileSAM.SetImage(UnityEngine.Texture)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> to specify the image you want to generate masks for.\nAfter setting an image you can call <xref href=\"Doji.AI.Segmentation.MobileSAM.Predict(System.Single%5b%5d%2cSystem.Single%5b%5d)\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref>\nto get the masks. The results will be stored in the <xref href=\"Doji.AI.Segmentation.MobileSAM.Result\" data-throw-if-not-resolved=\"false\"></xref> RenderTexture.</p>\n"
    },
